  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e6be890c8a758f3488227c7687955d0c, type: 3}
  m_Name: PogoUnlock
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TaleStoneData
  DialogueLines:
  - textVI: "R\u01A1i xu\u1ED1ng kh\xF4ng c\xF3 ngh\u0129a l\xE0 th\u1EA5t b\u1EA1i,
      h\u1EE1i ng\u1ECDn l\u1EEDa nh\u1ECF. \u0110\xF4i khi, \u0111\xF3 l\xE0 c\xE1ch
      \u0111\u1EC3 con m\u01B0\u1EE3n l\u1EA5y s\u1EE9c n\u1EB7ng c\u1EE7a b\u1EA7u
      tr\u1EDDi."
    textEN: To fall is not to fail, little spark. Sometimes, it is how you harness
      the very weight of the sky.
    AutoSkip: 0
  - textVI: "H\xE3y d\u1ED3n to\xE0n b\u1ED9 s\u1EE9c m\u1EA1nh v\xE0o chi\u1EBFc
      \u0111u\xF4i, gi\xE1ng xu\u1ED1ng nh\u01B0 m\u1ED9t m\u1EA3nh thi\xEAn th\u1EA1ch,
      v\xE0 \u0111\u1EC3 ch\xEDnh s\u1EF1 va ch\u1EA1m \u1EA5y \u0111\u1EA9y con
      v\u1ECDt l\xEAn nh\u1EEFng t\u1EA7ng m\xE2y m\u1EDBi."
    textEN: Channel all your might into your tail, strike down like a falling star,
      and let the impact launch you towards new heavens.
    AutoSkip: 0
  AutoProgressDelay: 1.5
  TypingSpeed: 0.05
  IsActivated: 0
  IsKingMonolith: 0
  IsHeroMonolith: 0
